    summary: "Time is the one resource we cannot save or increase. This lesson studies Psalm 90:12, Ephesians 5:15-16, Ecclesiastes 3:1-8, Colossians 4:5 and James 4:13-15 to see that our days are numbered, that wise people use time with purpose, how to set priorities among work, family, church and rest, how to deal with busyness and distraction, and how to plan while submitting plans to God.",
    scripture: ["Psalm 90:10-12", "Ephesians 5:15-17"], more: ["Ecclesiastes 3:1-8", "Colossians 4:5", "James 4:13-15"], memory: "Psalm 90:12",
