    sa: ["How can believers steward their bodies?", ["temple", "rest", "health", "moderation", "care", "god"], "A good answer says the body belongs to God as his temple, so believers care for it with rest, healthy habits and moderation, avoiding harm and idolatry, and care for the sick with compassion."],
