    mcq1: ["What does Galatians 6:10 say?", ["As we have opportunity, let us do good to everyone", "Do good only to family", "Do good only to the rich", "Do good later"], 0, "Do good as we have opportunity."],
    mcq2: ["What does Proverbs 27:17 say?", ["Iron sharpens iron, and one man sharpens another", "Iron rusts", "Friends are unnecessary", "Man is alone"], 0, "Friends sharpen one another."],
