    sa: ["How can believers steward relationships and influence?", ["people", "invest", "serve", "influence", "mentor", "christ"], "A good answer says people matter more than things, so believers invest time and love in family, friends, church and neighbours, and use influence to serve, protect and build up, serving Christ in the needy."],
